<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA+ to British Columbia samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA+ to British Columbia samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Friday that it had assigned an AA+ rating to British Columbia's 70 billion yen worth of 4.9 percent yen/U.S. dollar dual currency bonds due February 29, 2000.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said in a statement that its rating outlook was negative.</p>
